# VASC — Driver Drowsiness Detection

Real-time drowsiness detection using a laptop webcam and a Vision Transformer (ViT) neural network. Built in MATLAB R2025b.

## Requirements

- MATLAB R2025b
- Deep Learning Toolbox
- MATLAB Support Package for USB Webcams
- Python 3.14 with `onnx` and `onnxruntime` installed

## Setup — Run Once

### 1. Merge the model files (Python)
```cmd
python merge_model.py
```

### 2. Convert to MATLAB format
Open MATLAB and run:
```matlab
cd('path\to\this\folder')
run('convert_model.m')
```
This creates `drowsiness_net.mat`.

## Run

```matlab
cd('path\to\this\folder')
run('VASC_simu_code.m')
```

Press **Q** in the figure window to stop.

## Files

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `VASC_simu_code.m` | Main detection loop |
| `convert_model.m` | Converts ONNX model to MATLAB format |
| `merge_model.py` | Merges model files before conversion |
| `drowsiness_model.onnx` | Model architecture |
| `drowsiness_model.onnx.data` | Model weights |
